              country="Korea, Republic of")),
    person(given="Rural Development Administration (RDA)", role="cph"),
    person(given="National Institute of Agricultural Sciences (NAS)", role="cph"))
Description: Implements Bayesian inference of directed pair-to-rest microbial dynamics for compositional longitudinal microbiome data, supporting qualified interaction screening. Residuals are OU (≈AR(1)) or white-noise with Δt-aware options; includes optional correlation-based screening, tidy edge reshaping, Kalman ELPD for OU, and diagnostics; uses cmdstanr/CmdStan.
